  "readme": "# enise\n\n----\n## what is enise?\nAn express-based node module to provide our students a pre-configured web-server engine with only two lines of code\n\n----\n## usage\n    require('enise');\n    Semvar server = enise.server({ port: 8080, verbose: true });\n\n----\n## changelog\n* 24-May-2013 initial commit",
